ums Femme</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Parfum</th><th>Marque</th><th>Prix Promo</th><th>Prix Original</th><th>Réduction</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Obsession Pour Femme</strong></td>\n<td>Calvin Klein</td>\n<td>34,99€</td>\n<td>138€</td>\n<td><strong>-75%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Mon Premier Parfum</strong></td>\n<td>Lolita Lempicka</td>\n<td>44,99€</td>\n<td>133€</td>\n<td><strong>-66%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>La Petite Robe Noire</strong></td>\n<td>Guerlain</td>\n<td>80,99€</td>\n<td>182€</td>\n<td><strong>-56%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p><div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://lk.gt/aQEUd\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir les parfums en promo <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Top Promos Parfums Homme</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"comparison-table\"><thead><tr>\n<th>Parfum</th><th>Marque</th><th>Prix Promo</th><th>Prix Original</th><th>Réduction</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Boucheron Pour Homme</strong></td>\n<td>Boucheron</td>\n<td>38,99€</td>\n<td>133€</td>\n<td><strong>-71%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>1881 Pour Homme</strong></td>\n<td>Cerruti</td>\n<td>37,99€</td>\n<td>100€</td>\n<td><strong>-62%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>L'Eau d'Issey Intense</strong></td>\n<td>Issey Miyake</td>\n<td>45,99€</td>\n<td>116€</td>\n<td><strong>-60%</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p><div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-heigh